  "description": "Change of use of existing ground floor office to flexible Class E commercial use (office, retail, cafe / coffee shop and professional services), provision to subdivide to create up to two commercial units and proposed new shopfront (shopfront as per approved scheme under planning permission 2020/3055).",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-23d272e7-7fff-a098-6bda-e0fad7aafee8&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Notwithstanding the approved plans, documents and details, detailed drawings and full particulars of the following shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the start of the relevant part of the development. a) The proposed shopfronts in the form of a 1:20 elevation showing the pane pattern and layout and 1:20 vertical section drawings together with 1:5 section details of frames and doors, showing the material, profile and design of the the shopfront; b) Details of all signage, security fittings, lighting, lettering and other elements attached or applied to the shopfronts; c) Details of all new and replacement windows and doors in the form of a 1:20 elevation showing the design and pane pattern and 1:5 sections showing the profile and material of the elements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To safeguard the character and appearance of the site and surrounding Conservation Area.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
